Immutable class:
-it is a class where the state of objrct can not be changed once it is created
-once the field of an object are assigned some values, it can't be updated
-it is read only class

when we create immutable classes it follow the set of ruleS:
Rules of Immutability in a class:
1) no setter method inside class
2)filed must be private
3)initialization of fields using constructor

